@startuml
title ATM Control - Withdrawal Scenario

state InitialState
state WaitingForInput
state ChoosingAmount
state SelectingPredefinedAmount
state EnteringCustomAmount
state CancellingTransaction
state ProcessingWithdrawal
state DispensingCash
state PrintingReceipt
state EjectingCard
state TerminalState

InitialState --> WaitingForInput : User interacts with ATM
WaitingForInput --> ChoosingAmount : User chooses option
ChoosingAmount --> SelectingPredefinedAmount : Predefined amount selected
ChoosingAmount --> EnteringCustomAmount : Custom amount entered
SelectingPredefinedAmount --> DispensingCash : Amount dispensed
EnteringCustomAmount --> ProcessingWithdrawal : Valid amount entered
ProcessingWithdrawal --> DispensingCash : Withdrawal approved
ProcessingWithdrawal --> EjectingCard : Rejected / Eject, Display Apology
CancellingTransaction --> EjectingCard : Cancel / Eject
DispensingCash --> PrintingReceipt : Cash dispensed
PrintingReceipt --> EjectingCard : Receipt printed
EjectingCard --> TerminalState : Card ejected
TerminalState --> [*] : COMPLETION_EVENT
@enduml
